    {
      "id": "claim_6866da08720144d4b5307448f4a9accf",
      "statement": "The deepagents-acp package provides a connector that runs a Python Deep Agent as an Agent Client Protocol (ACP) server, letting ACP-capable editors like Zed drive the agent over stdio.",
