    {
      "id": "claim_2cc01c829105403a9e90543b0ae3fa29",
      "statement": "An 'always allow' approval records a non-shell tool or extracted shell command type in an in-memory per-session allowlist; later execute calls are auto-approved only when every command type is allowed and no dangerous shell pattern is present.",
