      "statement": "With load_sessions=True the server implements ACP session/load by restoring the LangGraph thread, verifying the persisted cwd matches the requested working directory (else invalid_params), rejecting unknown sessions with resource_not_found, and replaying the stored conversation to the client before returning.",
